{"tid":8662,"title":"CoD Black Ops: IP join?","fid":21,"partial":false,"preserved":15,"expected":15,"last_date":"2010-11-12T18:22:00","crumbs":[{"name":"General","fid":3},{"name":"Help & Support","fid":21}],"users":{"Christopher":{"name":"Christopher","color":"purple","bold":true,"title":"Super Donator","joined":"Feb 2010","posts":1498,"avatar":"3385.png"},"JayHawk":{"name":"JayHawk","color":"red","bold":true,"title":"Server Admin","joined":"Apr 2010","posts":419,"avatar":"3641.jpg"},"danne":{"name":"danne","color":"red","bold":true,"title":"Server Admin","joined":"Feb 2010","posts":370,"avatar":null},"YardiThomas":{"name":"YardiThomas","color":"purple","bold":true,"title":"Super Donator","joined":"Jun 2009","posts":1427,"avatar":null},"Aftershock":{"name":"Aftershock","color":"purple","bold":true,"title":"Super Donator","joined":"Jun 2010","posts":104,"avatar":null},"Leon Ladisic °_°":{"name":"Leon Ladisic °_°","color":null,"bold":true,"title":"Veteran","joined":"Jan 2010","posts":1034,"avatar":null},"beasty":{"name":"beasty","color":"purple","bold":true,"title":"Super Donator","joined":"Apr 2010","posts":1075,"avatar":"3667.png"},"TJjokerR":{"name":"TJjokerR","color":"red","bold":true,"title":"Server Admin","joined":"Dec 2008","posts":2376,"avatar":null},"iShot":{"name":"iShot","color":"red","bold":true,"title":"Server Admin","joined":"Jan 2010","posts":1394,"avatar":"3232.png"},"playscott357":{"name":"playscott357","color":null,"bold":true,"title":"Member","joined":"Jul 2009","posts":138,"avatar":null},"Nobody":{"name":"Nobody","color":"purple","bold":true,"title":"Super Donator","joined":"Feb 2010","posts":224,"avatar":null}},"posts":[{"pid":121800,"num":1,"date":"2010-11-11T17:01:00","author":"Christopher","usertitle":"Super Donator","joined":"Feb 2010","author_posts":575,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEh, rather simple question.. How do you join a Black Ops server by IP<br/>\n<br/>\r\nE.g: I'd like to join the VM CoD server, how do I do this?\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":"<div>Pre-ordered or going to order Black Ops? Add <b>Divyak</b> to steam and we may team up sometime <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20101124035029im_/http://ventmob.com/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" title=\"Big Grin\"/>!<br/>\n<br/>\n<b><u><div align=\"center\">Bored? Frustrated? CSS Fanatic?</div></u></b><br/>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.core-gaming.org\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20101124035029im_/http://core-gaming.org/images/stories/demo/frontpage/rokstories2.jpg\"/></a></div></div>"},{"pid":121810,"num":2,"date":"2010-11-11T17:24:00","author":"JayHawk","usertitle":"Server Admin","joined":"Apr 2010","author_posts":419,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\n<div class=\"bbcode_container\">\n<div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div>\n<pre class=\"bbcode_code\" style=\"height:36px\">Connect &lt;IP&gt;</pre>\n</div> In console\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":"<div><div align=\"center\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20101124035029im_/http://www.ishots-cave.com/ventmob/signatures/generated/66340705.png\"/></div></div>"},{"pid":121813,"num":3,"date":"2010-11-11T17:50:00","author":"danne","usertitle":"Server Admin","joined":"Feb 2010","author_posts":370,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\n<div class=\"bbcode_container\">\n<div class=\"bbcode_quote\">\n<div class=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"bbcode_quote_container\"></div>\n<div class=\"bbcode_postedby\">\nQuote Originally Posted by <strong>JayHawk</strong>\n<a href=\"archive.php?t=8662#post121810\">View Post</a>\n</div>\n<div><div class=\"bbcode_container\">\n<div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div>\n<pre class=\"bbcode_code\" style=\"height:36px\">Connect &lt;IP&gt;</pre>\n</div> In console</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> Doesnt work, There is no connect command for the moment, however it is a disconnect command...\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":"<div><div align=\"center\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20101124035029im_/http://www.ishots-cave.com/ventmob/signatures/generated/111733996.png\"/></div><br/>\n<div class=\"bbcode_container\">\n<div class=\"bbcode_quote\">\n<div class=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"bbcode_quote_container\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\tUnnamed: i think you were another person sorry!? for my sorry please i will give you 100<br/>\r\ndolalrs !\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\n</div>\n</div> My TF2 backpack: <a href=\"http://www.tf2items.com/profiles/76561197988567758\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.tf2items.com/profiles/76561197988567758</a></div>"},{"pid":121815,"num":4,"date":"2010-11-11T18:03:00","author":"YardiThomas","usertitle":"Super Donator","joined":"Jun 2009","author_posts":1414,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCurrently, until Treyarch of GameServers say otherwise, the only way to connect to your server is via the ever so slightly flakey &amp; overloaded server browser. IP Connect isn't working or not in the Console commands at all.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":"<div><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20101124035029im_/http://www.upload.ee/image/871202/Windows_XP.gif\"/><br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20101124035029im_/http://i63.photobucket.com/albums/h131/bundi_jr/googlechrome2.png\"/></div>"},{"pid":121862,"num":5,"date":"2010-11-11T19:58:00","author":"Aftershock","usertitle":"Super Donator","joined":"Jun 2010","author_po